SUMMARY:DAST 2027 Artist Registration
DESCRIPTION:Registration is open for the 2027 Davis Art Studio Tour!  \nThe two-day tour of Davis-based art studios is self-guided and free to the public. The Davis Art Studio Tour highlights the artwork and creativity from a wide range of artists from the community. \n\nhttps://www.davisopenstudios.com/ \nPayment and completed form are due no later than midnight\, January 17\, 2027 to be included in the Davis Art Studio Tour. \nThis Studio Tour is for Davis art studios only. Artists from out of the area can be a guest in a Davis art studio. However\, if there are multiple artists at one single address\, each artist must complete their own form. \nFeel free to reach out to other artists and join together. Having multiple artists in one location increases traffic on tour weekend. Just make sure you put the actual studio address where you will be down when signing up. \n\nTour details:\nMay 15-16\, 2027\, 10:00 a.m-5:00 p.m.\nPreview show and 2nd Friday ArtAbout Reception at the Pence Gallery TBD \nQuestions? ArtistsinDavisCA@gmail.com
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/dast-2027-artist-registration/
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-17-at-1.48.06-PM.jpg
END:VEVENT
