SUMMARY:Light & Grain
DESCRIPTION:The Artery presents “Light & Grain\,” a two-person exhibition featuring oil painter Kristina Kernytska and woodworker Viktor Ivantsov. \nThe exhibition runs October 30 through November 23\, with an artists’ reception on Friday\, November 13\, from 6–9 p.m.\, coinciding with the Davis Second Friday ArtAbout. \n“Light & Grain” brings together two distinct approaches to natural beauty: the raw\, carved grain of wood and the vibrant\, textured light of oil paint. Kristina Kernytska’s paintings and Viktor Ivantsov’s wood carvings invite viewers to experience nature through texture\, memory\, and light.\nTogether\, the works celebrate the landscapes and living world that inspire both artists.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/light-grain/
LOCATION:The Artery\, 207 G Street\, Davis\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art
GEO:38.5438665;-121.73916
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Artery 207 G Street Davis CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=207 G Street:geo:-121.73916,38.5438665
END:VEVENT
