DESCRIPTION:5K WALK/RUN TRAINING PROGRAM WITH COACH STEVE\n\nOCT. 7 – NOV. 26 WEDNESDAYS: 6PM – 7PM & SATURDAYS: 8AM – 9:30AM\n\nREGISTRATION FOR CLASS IS $30 PER PERSON\n\nGet moving and build confidence in a supportive\, beginner-friendly environment!\n\nJoin instructor Steve Bonnel for this 8-week training program designed to help you comfortably prepare for a 5K walk or run-just in time for the Woodland Turkey Trot on November 26\n\n\n Woodland Community & Senior Center: \n\n2001 East St\nWoodland\, CA  95776\nUnited States
